  m_Name: ArcadeGameCorona
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 87
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Corona
  Description: 'Mantas only - shells of prisms round a heart of omni crystals, and the only way in is
    through the gates. Skim a shell to arm a bomb, graze a rival to plant it, then dive
    through the gates and touch a crystal to set every bomb you planted off at once. Every
    rival a bloom catches is a point that silences them. Never touch a shell with your hull
    - that sets your bombs off early. Higher intensities add shells, narrow the gates, rim
    them in danger and thin the crystals. First team to the target wins.'
